# Klingon Strike Force: Trample (CR 702.19b) assigns lethal damage to its blocker and the excess to the player. Bot2's
# Grizzly Bears blocks on turn 3, so 2 of the 5 goes to the Bears (which dies) and 3 tramples to Bot2; without trample all
# 5 would stop on the Bears. In Main2 Go for the Throat destroys the Force and its dies trigger deals exactly 2 more to
# Bot2 (CR 700.4, 603.10a, 120.3).

